{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AiT91thZz21795644377.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港鐵屯馬綫逐步回復正常。</p><p></p><p>[06:05]</p><p>港鐵指由於天水圍站有工程車設備故障，正將工程車移離行車線，屯馬綫列車班次需要調整。</p><p></p><p>港鐵指候車時間預計比平日多10至15分鐘。而來往屯門至元朗預計25分鐘一班，來往元朗至烏溪沙8分鐘一班。港鐵現正提供免費接駁巴士，來往元朗站和屯門站，途經沿途各站。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T22:56:56.952688+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T22:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T00:31:00.001030+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T22:50:12.247268+00:00","content_hash":"16ce7254c7af00c368bd7247047194d78b173011bf003b6c8fa2f3da08951380","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T22:56:56.952688+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}